{
    "definition": {
        "$schema": "https://schema.management.azure.com/providers/Microsoft.Logic/schemas/2016-06-01/workflowdefinition.json#",
        "actions": {
            "Entities_-_Get": {
                "inputs": {
                    "body": {
                        "incidentId": "@triggerBody()?['object']?['id']"
                    },
                    "host": {
                        "connection": {
                            "name": "@parameters('$connections')['azuresentinel']['connectionId']"
                        }
                    },
                    "method": "post",
                    "path": "/Incidents/@{encodeURIComponent(triggerBody()?['object']?['id'])}/entities"
                },
                "runAfter": {},
                "type": "ApiConnection"
            },
            "Construct_Checklist": {
                "inputs": [
                    {
                        "Title": "1. Get list of impacted users",
                        "Description": "<p>Identify all recipients for this alert subject.</p><br><strong>Run KQL:</strong><pre>EmailEvents\n| where Subject == '@{triggerBody()?['object']?['properties']?['title']}'\n| summarize count() by RecipientEmailAddress</pre>"
                    },
                    {
                        "Title": "2. Check latest mailbox access",
                        "Description": "<p>Check if the attacker accessed mail items.</p><br><strong>Run KQL:</strong><pre>CloudAppEvents\n| where ActionType == 'MailItemsAccessed'\n| where AccountUpn == '@{coalesce(body('Entities_-_Get')?['Accounts']?[0]?['Name'], 'NO_USER_FOUND')}'</pre>"
                    },
                    {
                        "Title": "3. Check Delegate Access",
                        "Description": "<p>Did they add a delegate?</p><br><strong>Run KQL:</strong><pre>CloudAppEvents\n| where ActionType == 'Add-MailboxPermission'\n| where AccountUpn == '@{coalesce(body('Entities_-_Get')?['Accounts']?[0]?['Name'], 'NO_USER_FOUND')}'</pre>"
                    },
                    {
                        "Title": "4. Check Forwarding Rules",
                        "Description": "<p>Look for malicious rules.</p><br><strong>Run KQL:</strong><pre>CloudAppEvents\n| where ActionType in ('New-InboxRule', 'Set-InboxRule')\n| where AccountUpn == '@{coalesce(body('Entities_-_Get')?['Accounts']?[0]?['Name'], 'NO_USER_FOUND')}'</pre>"
                    },
                    {
                        "Title": "5. Did user read/open email?",
                        "Description": "<p>Check delivery action for this subject.</p><br><strong>Run KQL:</strong><pre>EmailPostDeliveryEvents\n| where ActionType == 'Read'\n| join kind=inner (EmailEvents | where Subject == '@{triggerBody()?['object']?['properties']?['title']}') on NetworkMessageId</pre>"
                    },
                    {
                        "Title": "6. Who else got the same email?",
                        "Description": "<p>Scope the attack by Sender.</p><br><strong>Run KQL:</strong><pre>EmailEvents\n| where SenderIPv4 == '@{coalesce(body('Entities_-_Get')?['Ips']?[0]?['Address'], 'NO_IP_FOUND')}'\n| summarize count() by RecipientEmailAddress</pre>"
                    },
                    {
                        "Title": "7. Check for Attachment",
                        "Description": "<p>Get attachment details for this subject.</p><br><strong>Run KQL:</strong><pre>EmailAttachmentInfo\n| join kind=inner (EmailEvents | where Subject == '@{triggerBody()?['object']?['properties']?['title']}') on NetworkMessageId</pre>"
                    },
                    {
                        "Title": "8. Analyze Attachment Payload",
                        "Description": "<p>Check file hash.</p><br><strong>Run KQL:</strong><pre>EmailAttachmentInfo\n| join kind=inner (EmailEvents | where Subject == '@{triggerBody()?['object']?['properties']?['title']}') on NetworkMessageId\n| project SHA256, FileName</pre>"
                    },
                    {
                        "Title": "9. Check True Sender Source",
                        "Description": "<p>Analyze IP and Headers.</p><br><strong>Run KQL:</strong><pre>EmailEvents\n| where Subject == '@{triggerBody()?['object']?['properties']?['title']}'\n| project SenderIPv4, AuthenticationDetails</pre>"
                    },
                    {
                        "Title": "10. Find Email Message ID",
                        "Description": "<p>Get the IDs for tracking.</p><br><strong>Run KQL:</strong><pre>EmailEvents\n| where Subject == '@{triggerBody()?['object']?['properties']?['title']}'\n| project NetworkMessageId, InternetMessageId</pre>"
                    },
                    {
                        "Title": "11. Did user click links?",
                        "Description": "<p>Verify Clicks on the specific URL found in alert.</p><br><strong>Run KQL:</strong><pre>UrlClickEvents\n| where Url has '@{coalesce(body('Entities_-_Get')?['Urls']?[0]?['Url'], 'NO_URL_FOUND')}'\n| project TimeGenerated, ActionType</pre>"
                    },
                    {
                        "Title": "12. Identify Endpoint",
                        "Description": "<p>Find the machine name associated with the click.</p><br><strong>Run KQL:</strong><pre>DeviceNetworkEvents\n| where RemoteUrl has '@{coalesce(body('Entities_-_Get')?['Urls']?[0]?['Url'], 'NO_URL_FOUND')}'\n| project DeviceName, DeviceId</pre>"
                    },
                    {
                        "Title": "13. Destination Touched?",
                        "Description": "<p>Did the device connect to the Malicious IP?</p><br><strong>Run KQL:</strong><pre>DeviceNetworkEvents\n| where RemoteIP == '@{coalesce(body('Entities_-_Get')?['Ips']?[0]?['Address'], 'NO_IP_FOUND')}'\n| where ActionType == 'ConnectionSuccess'</pre>"
                    },
                    {
                        "Title": "14. Federated Sign-in Logs",
                        "Description": "<p>Check ADFS logs for the user.</p><br><strong>Run KQL:</strong><pre>IdentityLogonEvents\n| where AccountUpn == '@{coalesce(body('Entities_-_Get')?['Accounts']?[0]?['Name'], 'NO_USER_FOUND')}'\n| where LogonType == 'Federated'</pre>"
                    },
                    {
                        "Title": "15
